{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01213",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.76,
      "end_seconds": 3.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Sorry I'm a little late, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.75,
      "end_seconds": 9.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 11.12,
      "end_seconds": 17.76,
      "duration_seconds": 6.64,
      "text": "Doctor, you know, I've come along because I know the history, if it helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.9,
      "end_seconds": 23.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Right, yes, that's no problem at all. Please sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 28.21,
      "end_seconds": 32.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Erm, we came because of loose stools after meals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.64,
      "end_seconds": 40.69,
      "duration_seconds": 6.05,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 42.46,
      "end_seconds": 51.58,
      "duration_seconds": 9.12,
      "text": "Oh, you know, he is on loperamide, 2 milligrams, when needed, I give it to him."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.35,
      "end_seconds": 55.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.89,
      "end_seconds": 60.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "Since this morning, that's when it began."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.31,
      "end_seconds": 64.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "What brings it on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.71,
      "end_seconds": 71.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Stress and coffee definitely sets it off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.3,
      "end_seconds": 75.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "How troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.99,
      "end_seconds": 82.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "A seven out of ten, I suppose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.0,
      "end_seconds": 86.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "How often do you get it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.98,
      "end_seconds": 91.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "It happens a few times a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.41,
      "end_seconds": 94.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Understood. Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.54,
      "end_seconds": 119.31,
      "duration_seconds": 23.77,
      "text": "Cramping lower tummy pain goes along with it, you know, most of the time. The cramping lower tummy pain? That's been for three weeks. As for cramping lower tummy pain, I'd say all the time. And urgency, too. Yeah, as for urgency, moderate, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.24,
      "end_seconds": 124.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Any blood in the stool, weight loss or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.65,
      "end_seconds": 130.41,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "No blood in the stool, weight loss or fever, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.39,
      "end_seconds": 134.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Has your skin been okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.38,
      "end_seconds": 138.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Erm, no, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.91,
      "end_seconds": 141.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.66,
      "end_seconds": 144.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.23,
      "end_seconds": 152.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.93,
      "end_seconds": 158.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "Okay, so no, nothing I can think of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.31,
      "end_seconds": 163.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.75,
      "end_seconds": 170.42,
      "duration_seconds": 6.67,
      "text": "Yes, you know, I had a meniscus repair on my knee, four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.2,
      "end_seconds": 174.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.23,
      "end_seconds": 178.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Well, my son has asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.09,
      "end_seconds": 180.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.44,
      "end_seconds": 185.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.55,
      "end_seconds": 193.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Alright, are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.67,
      "end_seconds": 203.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.84,
      "end_seconds": 207.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.81,
      "end_seconds": 210.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.64,
      "end_seconds": 234.02,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "Okay, do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.28,
      "end_seconds": 238.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.71,
      "end_seconds": 243.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.01,
      "end_seconds": 259.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.79,
      "end_seconds": 285.52,
      "duration_seconds": 8.73,
      "text": "Okay: weight 73 kilos, height 157 centimetres, BP is 127 over 77, BMI works out to 29.6, heart rate 76."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.8,
      "end_seconds": 292.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.35,
      "end_seconds": 305.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.76,
      "end_seconds": 309.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.32,
      "end_seconds": 323.43,
      "duration_seconds": 5.11,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft and only mildly tender on the left."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.97,
      "end_seconds": 336.29,
      "duration_seconds": 8.32,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. Having listened and examined, my working impression is irritable bowel syndrome with diarrhoea."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.0,
      "end_seconds": 341.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Is this serious, uh, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.71,
      "end_seconds": 354.08,
      "duration_seconds": 7.37,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like irritable bowel syndrome with diarrhoea."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 364.83,
      "end_seconds": 373.13,
      "duration_seconds": 8.3,
      "text": "Keep a food diary and cut back on coffee. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 374.49,
      "end_seconds": 378.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Um, great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 379.39,
      "end_seconds": 380.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}